"k_guide_new_app_title" = "Bathandi abathandekayo";
"k_guide_new_app_content" = "Sawubona! Siyacela uxolo ngalesi sithiyo esikubangelile. Phambilini, ngenxa yokuthi isicelo sethu assihambelani ngokugcwele nemigomo efanele ye-Appla, sabika futhi sathathwa ezitolo. Ngemva kokuzama kwethu konke kokulungisa kuleli thuluzi, sixazulule zonke izinkinga futhi sathumele isicelo esisha impumelelo.  \nUkuze uqinisekise ukuthi ungakwazi ukuqhubeka ujabule ngesevisi ezinzile, ezihambisana nemigomo, nezisezingeni eliphezulu, lesi sicelo samanje sizosuswa maduze, futhi kudingeka ukuthi ulayishe isicelo sethu esisha ukuqhubeka usebenzisa izinsizakalo zethu. Isicelo esisha asikaxazululi kuphela izinkinga zangaphambili kodwa siphinde sathuthukisa nokwandisa umsebenzi kanye nokuhlangenwe nakho komsebenzisi. Sithemba ukuthi sizokunikeza olunye ulwazi olungcono.  \nSiyabonga ngokuqhubekayo ngokusekela nokuqonda. Sicela unikeze nezinye ithuba lokuk hizmet. Ungachofoza kuleli xhumanisi ngezansi ukuze uqonde kwi-App Store kulayishe isicelo esisha. Uma uneminye imibuzo noma udinga usizo, sukuma ukhulume nathi nganoma yisiphi isikhathi.";
